## 4. Domain values (from code)
**Statuses** — `src/invoices.js:2`: `draft`, `sent`, `paid`, `void`. `void` is terminal (`src/invoices.js:10`).

**Roles** — **UNKNOWN / not defined in one place.** The only role referenced in code is `admin` (`src/invoices.js:11`). No role enum, and no `member` role, exists in the codebase. PRD names actors "Finance staff and organization admins" (`projects/demo/PRD.md:7`). Today *any non-admin actor* can make every transition except to `void` — i.e. "members" can already change status draft/sent/paid.

**Tenancy** — invoices are scoped by `orgId` (`src/invoices.js:15-16`), but `changeStatus` does not check that the actor belongs to the invoice's org.

