## Owner questions (must all be answered)
1. Who is a "member"? Finance staff, any org user, or a new role? (No role list exists.)
2. For each status, which roles may set it: `draft` / `sent` / `paid` / `void`?
3. Should `void` stay admin-only (keep R2) with a member "request void" flow instead, or should R2 change?
4. Should non-admins keep the current ability to mark `paid`, and should backward moves (e.g. `paid`→`draft`) be allowed at all? Today no transition order is enforced.
5. Should `changeStatus` enforce actor org == invoice org? (Existing gap, out of scope unless you add it.)
6. Confirm the problem/value statement and urgency.

